  body: none
}

docs {
  **Releases the escrow.** The money moves to the seller's payable balance the
  moment this succeeds.

  Orders that are never confirmed auto-complete after the window snapshotted
  onto them at payment time — three days for pickup, seven for delivery by
  default. An open dispute stops that sweep entirely.
}
